      "text": " She got gold in her very first pan."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:20.300",
      "start": "00:00:14.967",
      "text": " That's my guarantee for my school that you will get gold in your very first pan."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.533",
      "start": "00:00:20.300",
      "text": " She's happy, I'm happy."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:25.767",
