      "text": " Ray got gold."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:27.500",
      "start": "00:00:25.767",
      "text": " We're going to do some more digging here."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:29.300",
      "start": "00:00:27.500",
      "text": " Of course we do, Snarell, let's do it."
    },
    {
